#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:26
msgid "Link Dupont"
msgstr "Link Dupont"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:27
msgid "Automatically set wallpaper images from Internet sources"
msgstr "Stel automatisch achtergronden in van internetbronnen"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:29
msgid ""
"Damask is an automatic wallpaper application. It currently supports setting "
"the wallpaper image from the following sources:"
msgstr ""
"Damask is een toepassing die automatisch achtergronden instelt. Momenteel "
"ondersteunt deze de volgende bronnen:"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:31
msgid "wallhaven.cc"
msgstr "wallhaven.cc"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:32
msgid "Microsoft Bing Wallpaper of the day"
msgstr "Microsoft Bing - Achtergrond van de dag"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:33
msgid "NASA Astronomy Picture of the Day"
msgstr "NASA Astronomy - Foto van de dag"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:34
msgid "Unsplash"
msgstr "Unsplash"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:45
msgid "Added French and Dutch translations"
msgstr "Nieuw: Franse en Nederlandse vertalingen"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:46
msgid "Added \"Slideshow\" source to rotate through images in a local folder"
msgstr ""
"Nieuw: diavoorstellingsfunctie die meerdere afbeeldingen uit een lokale map "
"toont"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:47
msgid "Fixed an issue using the Wallhaven NSFW filter without an API key"
msgstr "Opgelost: probleem met het Wallhaven NSFW-filter zonder api-sleutel"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:48
msgid "Fixed an issue using the Unsplash ncontent_filter setting"
msgstr "Opgelost: probleem met de Unsplash-instellingen ‘ncontent_filter’"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:49
msgid "Changed the default refresh interval to 15 minutes"
msgstr "Gewijzigd: de standaard ververstussenpoos is voortaan 15 minuten"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:56
msgid "Add \"wallpaper\" keyword to desktop file"
msgstr "‘achtergrond’ toegevoegd aan desktopbestand"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:57
msgid "Disable \"Anime\" category in the wallhaven source by default"
msgstr "Nieuw: Anime-categorie in Wallhaven standaard uitgeschakeld"

#: data/app.drey.Damask.metainfo.xml.in.in:58
msgid ""
"Dynamically disable sources that require certain values such as API key to "
"function"
msgstr ""
"Nieuw: bronnen die bepaalde waarden, zoals api-sleutels, verwachten worden "
"dynamisch uitgeschakeld"

